			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761170201,
					"content": "…嘖，真是個窮光蛋，怎麼什麼東西都沒有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170202,
					"content": "喂，卡列瓦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170203,
					"content": "誰…哦喲，雅珂達，真是稀客上門，有什麼事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170204,
					"content": "沒事，你前幾天搶了一個叫伊赫安提的人，從他那裡拿了點東西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170205,
					"content": "這些錢你拿著，東西拿出來。今天我發好心，這東西當我從你們手上買的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170206,
					"content": "不愧是背靠奈芙爾的人，看看這作風…真有水準。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170207,
					"content": "那我要是不給妳，妳又能怎麼樣？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170208,
					"content": "呼…卡列瓦，我拜託你，你和你的那群傻瓜兄弟，能不能做一次正常人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170209,
					"content": "雅珂達，妳大老遠地跑過來，想要從一個賊的手上「買東西」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170210,
					"content": "塞進懷裡的肉，我還能丟出來給妳？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170211,
					"content": "怎麼感覺，這場談判已經破裂了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170212,
					"content": "呼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170213,
					"content": "我的錯，卡列瓦。我就不該學奈姐的作風和你們打交道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170214,
					"content": "你們這群白痴，唯一看得懂的談判手段就是拳頭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170215,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，來，我們一起撂倒他們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761170216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "雅珂達"
				},
				{
					"id": 761170216,
					"content": "看不起誰呢？兄弟們一起上！新仇舊恨，今天我們一起報了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "卡列瓦"
				}
			]
		},
		{
